      "summary": "Apps that support account creation must let people start deleting the account from inside the app. Deletion must remove the account record and its personal data; only deactivating, disabling, or signing out is insufficient. Outside highly regulated industries, the app may not require a phone call, email, or support flow. A web step is allowed only when the in-app link goes straight to the page that completes deletion. Apps using Sign in with Apple must revoke the user's tokens with the Sign in with Apple REST API.",
