      "applies_when": [],
      "summary": "Apps that transmit viruses, files, or code that can harm or disrupt the operating system or hardware features, including Push Notifications and Game Center, are rejected, and egregious or repeat cases lead to removal from the Apple Developer Program. Push floods, Game Center score or achievement spam, and payloads that crash other apps fall here.",
      "fix": "Remove the behavior and any SDK that causes it. Rate-limit pushes and submit only real scores and achievements.",
      "review": [
        "Can the app send files, links, or code to other people or devices that could harm or disrupt them?",
        "Does the app send push notifications or Game Center data at a volume or in a form that disrupts the service?",
        "Has every bundled SDK and binary come from a known, current source?"
      ]
    },
    {
