      "applies_when": [],
      "summary": "App Store Connect API keys (`.p8`), certificate bundles (`.p12`), PEM private keys, Android keystores, service-account JSON files, and `.env` files sometimes land in Copy Bundle Resources or a synchronized folder. Anyone who unzips the IPA gets them. `embedded.mobileprovision` and `GoogleService-Info.plist` are expected in the bundle and are not flagged.",
      "fix": "Remove the file from every target's membership and from the repository, then revoke and reissue the credential. Keep signing material in the keychain or CI secrets.",
