      "applies_when": [],
      "summary": "Stripe `sk_test_`, `pk_test_`, and `rk_test_` keys, or a Braintree `sandbox_` tokenization key, in the release build mean checkout runs in test mode: the reviewer sees a payment succeed that charges nothing, and real customers cannot pay. A test secret key in the binary also exposes the test account.",
      "fix": "Select keys per build configuration so Release uses live publishable keys, and keep secret keys on the server. Gate any test key behind `#if DEBUG`.",
