      "fix": "Call `ATTrackingManager.requestTrackingAuthorization` once the app is active, for example from the first screen's task or after `sceneDidBecomeActive`, not in `application(_:didFinishLaunchingWithOptions:)`. If the app does not track, remove the purpose string and set tracking to No in App Privacy. Say in the review notes where the prompt appears.",
